{"id":"W33706799f2140733fd4cba32","zh":"车体横向振动加速度","en":"","name":"车体横向振动加速度","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W33706799f2140733fd4cba32","text":"车体横向振动加速度","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sfef6f18ab53b19893ba7","source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"从图6 可知: 不同类型轨道不平顺小波尺度系数与车体横向振动加速度的相关性分析结果同车体横向振动加速度的Fourier 谱分析结果基本一致,如在图6 (a) 所示的谱分布图中显著存在的 2.","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S3802ad443588db3d2469","source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"统计分析表明: 车体横向振动加速度受多种类型轨道不平顺影响, 在激振频率处,各不平顺类型在此频率处同时出现波峰或波谷; 在1 ~3 m 短波长部分的激振频率,需提高分析精度才能获得显著性频率,与车体垂向振动分析结果一致。","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P121":{"id":"P121","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","authors":"宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.03.006","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"宁迎智等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"车体横向响应信号，用于识别相关激振波长和不平顺类型。","language":"zh","source_id":"P121","paper_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W2904e56ef15a4223af3cab08","name":"Car-body lateral vibration acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W2904e56ef15a4223af3cab08","name":"Car-body lateral vibration acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms"